<title>MALAYSIA: RINGGIT FALLS TO FRESH 42-MONTH LOWS VS DOLLAR.</title>
<headline>RINGGIT FALLS TO FRESH 42-MONTH LOWS VS DOLLAR.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The ringgit fell to fresh 42-month lows against the dollar in late morning trading on Monday on continued sales by offshore and local players, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0355 GMT, the ringgit was at 2.7100/20 to a dollar, its lowest level since March 28, 1994.</p>
